# PROJECT: IT Lab Solutions Limited — Professional IT Service Management & Business Operations Web Panel

## 1. Your Role

Act as a Senior Full-Stack Software Engineer, Software Architect, UI/UX Designer, Database Engineer, Security Engineer, and Business Management System Developer.

Build a complete, professional, production-ready Web Panel for IT Lab Solutions Limited.

This is a real business management application, not just a dashboard design or static HTML prototype.

The system must have a professional interface, a secure backend, a persistent database, role-based permissions, working forms, functional reports, printing, notifications, and proper authentication.

Before starting, inspect the existing project files and determine the current technology stack. If an existing project is provided, preserve its useful functionality and improve it without unnecessarily breaking existing features.

Do not merely provide instructions or sample code. Implement the application, test its functionality, and explain how to run and deploy it.

