## E. 30-Day WhatsApp Reminder

Create an integration-ready WhatsApp Business Platform/API module.

Requirements:

- Find eligible undelivered products that have reached 30 days since receiving.
- Send an approved WhatsApp reminder to the customer's registered WhatsApp number.
- Store the reminder timestamp and delivery status.
- Avoid duplicate reminders through configurable reminder rules.
- Stop further collection reminders after delivery.
- Retry failed messages according to a configurable policy.
- Display failed messages in an Admin follow-up queue.
- Allow authorized staff to record manual follow-up if automated messaging is unavailable.

The reminder scheduler must run on the backend. Do not rely on the browser being open.

Use approved WhatsApp templates where required. If API credentials are unavailable, implement a clear configuration screen and a test mode rather than falsely reporting that messages were sent.

